# Legacy keyword rewrites (prerender moved from functions/_middleware.js to
# static build/web/<slug>/index.html pages, baked by tools/prerender_seo.py).
# The 47 keyword URLs are now real static pages and Pages serves them
# directly, so no redirect rule is needed (and none may exist: a 200-rewrite
# would shadow the static file).

# Documents are exposed on the SEO pages as iprepa.tn links, so crawlers
# (ChatGPT/Google) see them as coming from the site. This rule 302s the clean
# URL to the worker's /api/view/ endpoint with the full R2 key (percent-
# encoded, slashes included) in the path; the worker resolves it as the exact
# key (its legacy no-?f= branch) and serves the PDF.
/view/* https://iloveprepa-r2.ilovepreparatoire.workers.dev/api/view/:splat 302